/E (Throughout my career in computer engineering, I have focused not only on developing applications but also on designing end-to-end technological systems. My professional journey began with system and network administration and has since expanded to include web applications, mobile applications, backend services, cloud infrastructure, DevOps processes, and AI-based solutions. Thanks to this multidisciplinary experience, I have developed an engineering perspective that allows me to evaluate not only the code side of a product but also its architecture, operational requirements, and long-term sustainability.)
