/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (In recent years, while developing scalable applications in the JavaScript, Dart, React Native, Flutter, Node.js, TypeScript, Java, and Python ecosystems, I managed modern software development lifecycles using Docker, Kubernetes, Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud Platform, and CI/CD technologies. I have taken an active role in mobile applications, smart home technologies, alarm systems, remote monitoring platforms, image processing solutions, and automation projects running in production environments, assuming responsibilities in both product development and technical leadership. My primary goals include simplifying complex problems, reducing technical debt, and creating sustainable software architectures. My primary goal has always been to earn and uphold the trust of the people I work with.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [19]
